    <section id="services">
      <h2>Expertise & Services</h2>
      <p>
        I help organizations build accessible, high-performing digital experiences that don't just
        meet EAA, ADA, and WCAG standards—they exceed them, creating sustainable compliance
        frameworks that scale with regulatory evolution.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <p>Consulting & Education</p>
          <h3>Custom Accessibility & Design System Workshops</h3>
          <p>
            Hands-on, tailored training that aligns corporate and academic teams on accessibility
            best practices. I translate complex standards into actionable workflows that ensure
            WCAG, EAA, and ADA compliance while establishing scalable, inclusive Design System
            foundations.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p>Consulting & Education</p>
          <h3>Thought Leadership & Public Speaking</h3>
          <p>
            Engaging presentations and keynotes for conferences, companies, and
            universities—exploring the intersection of UX excellence, frontend performance, and
            strategic accessibility planning. Each session connects technical precision with
            human-centered design outcomes.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p>Engineering & Systems</p>
          <h3>Accessible Frontend Development</h3>
          <p>
            Building high-quality, high-performance web applications with an unwavering focus on <strong
              >global accessibility compliance and governance</strong
            >. My engineering approach delivers maintainable, standards-based code that's both fast
            and inclusive by design.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p>Auditing & Strategy</p>
          <h3>Performance & Quality Audits</h3>
          <p>
            Strategic, in-depth analysis of existing codebases—delivering clear, actionable roadmaps
            to achieve international legal compliance (WCAG, EAA, ADA), optimize performance, and
            elevate overall product quality and sustainability.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
